BT82X BLOB
==========

BT82X uses a single flash driver blob for the whole generation, so there are no
per-chip folders and no per-part release notes like the BT815/6 and BT817/8
blobs have.

bt82x.blob in this folder is the blob the Flash Image Generator writes when a
BT82X part is selected. The Generator's Blob File list is scanned from
flash_blob/, so any other *.blob dropped here shows up in that list too, and
Browse… still takes any blob on the PC.

For the NOR blob history see ../bt815_6-blob/README and ../bt817_8-blob/README.
